# Board XNU patches, in application order.
# Shared patches come from the ARM64, SM6115 and OS profiles; board-specific
# patches stay in this repository.

# Board opt-in PMGR bridge hook; paired with CONFIG_XNU_SHENG_PMGR and build-platform-power.py.
sheng-platform-power.patch

# Board-only observation probe hook; the probe returns unless the matching boot argument is present.
gta4l-sdhci-snapshot.patch

# Board-only handoff audit and host-local init hooks; both return unless the matching boot argument is present.
gta4l-sdhci-handoff-audit.patch
